# Shadcn prefix

`components.json` cannot prefix component names. After any `npx shadcn add`, rename the primitive so it always uses the `Shadcn` prefix.

- File: `ShadcnButton.tsx`
- Export: `ShadcnButton`, `shadcnButtonVariants`
- `data-slot`: kebab-case with `shadcn-` (`data-slot="shadcn-button"`)
- Named groups: `group/shadcn-button`
- CSS that targets slots must use the prefixed value (`[data-slot=shadcn-button-group]`)

Keep `@/components/ui` unprefixed (`Button`) as thin wrappers over the shadcn primitives. Import each wrapper from its PascalCase file (`@/components/ui/Button`), not a barrel. The Button and Switch wrappers omit `size` and always pass `size="default"`.
